WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:18.555
Everyone turned to look at the door.

2
00:00:18.556 --> 00:00:21.269
"What's this?" said Mole.

3
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:26.268
A big basket of food stumbled in.

4
00:00:26.269 --> 00:00:30.474
The basket tipped this way and that.

5
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:34.736
Then Mole saw the choir leader under it.

6
00:00:34.737 --> 00:00:38.472
"He can't carry that much!" Mole yelled.

7
00:00:38.473 --> 00:00:42.536
Finally shy little Samuel said something.

8
00:00:42.537 --> 00:00:45.676
"Look out!" he shouted.

9
00:00:45.677 --> 00:00:51.540
The basket spilled, and food rolled across the floor.

10
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:54.941
Surprised, Mole looked around.

11
00:00:54.942 --> 00:01:00.949
"Pudding! Jam! Turnips! Potatoes! Candy!

12
00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:04.946
Where did it all come from?" said Mole.

13
00:01:04.947 --> 00:01:08.336
"The play is over!" shouted Rat.

14
00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:10.278
"Pick up the food!"

15
00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:12.542
All the mice scattered.

16
00:01:12.543 --> 00:01:16.078
"I got an apple!" cried one mouse.

17
00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:18.935
"Here are some carrots!" cried another.

18
00:01:18.936 --> 00:01:22.668
Two mice fought over a piece of candy.

19
00:01:22.669 --> 00:01:26.340
Rat gave directions to every mouse:

20
00:01:26.341 --> 00:01:28.152
"Get the butter dish!

21
00:01:28.153 --> 00:01:30.540
Don't forget the napkins!

22
00:01:30.541 --> 00:01:33.943
Who has the forks?"

23
00:01:33.944 --> 00:01:36.943
Soon supper was ready.

24
00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:40.137
Mole took his seat at the head of the table.

25
00:01:40.138 --> 00:01:43.286
The mice sat on both sides.

26
00:01:43.287 --> 00:01:45.739
Rat sat at the other end.

27
00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:50.336
"I can't believe it," sighed Mole.

28
00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:53.672
"What a happy homecoming this is!"

29
00:01:53.673 --> 00:01:59.693
"Let's eat!" cried Rat, with his fork held high.
